Aug 19 19:59:24 silt-ft-val-b-2323b09-20931 silt[1019]: bond: objective re-challenge TTL defaulted to 32 blocks for this untrusted (objective) swarm — standing lapses this many blocks after a validator's latest bond proof unless it renews, so a released plot can't keep voting. Override with -bond-ttl (0 disables; safe only for a trusted/demo swarm).
Aug 19 19:59:24 silt-ft-val-b-2323b09-20931 silt[1019]: consensus: Byzantine quorum sizing defaulted ON for this untrusted (objective) swarm — a commit needs a supermajority of the qualified bonded set so two quorums always share an honest validator. Override with -byzantine-quorum=false (safe only for a trusted swarm).
